  E(9)/E(8) = 37.0855, V ratio = 27.8395, m ratio = 1.2857, E_ratio/(V*m ratio) = 1.0361

  The E ratio grows FASTER than V*m ratio because density increases.
  E_ratio / (V*m ratio) approaches 1 (since avg_deg/m -> 1).


